# ============================================================
#  让 GitHub 的语言统计只反映"我们写的代码"
#  Drivers / Middlewares / USB_DEVICE 都是 ST 官方生成或厂商库，
#  标记成 vendored 后不会计入语言占比。
# ============================================================
F407Focd/focF407project1/Drivers/**      linguist-vendored
F407Focd/focF407project1/Middlewares/**  linguist-vendored
F407Focd/focF407project1/USB_DEVICE/**   linguist-vendored
F407Focd/focF407project1/Module/**       linguist-vendored
*.s                                       linguist-vendored

# 文档不计入语言统计
*.md                                      linguist-documentation
*.docx                                    linguist-documentation
*.pdf                                     linguist-documentation
docs/**                                   linguist-documentation

# 明确把核心算法标记为 C（避免被当成别的语言）
F407Focd/focF407project1/Core/Src/foc.c      linguist-language=C
F407Focd/focF407project1/Core/Src/encoder.c  linguist-language=C
F407Focd/focF407project1/Core/Src/main.c     linguist-language=C
F407Focd/focF407project1/vofa/*              linguist-language=C

# 换行符统一，避免 Windows/Linux 混杂
*.c    text eol=crlf
*.h    text eol=crlf
*.md   text eol=lf
